      "uco-core:name": "GNSS fix 6 of 15 at 2026-07-04T11:51:30.180Z",
      "uco-core:description": "GPS record joined to its paired GPA accuracy record; ground speed 5.249000072479248 m/s. This is the GNSS fix nearest the EKF-reported climb peak; the peak altitude itself is carried on the flight.",
